ce\": \"Clicked favorite toggle on Professional Resume to unfavorite. Immediate visual feedback: favorite state changed from \\\"on\\\" to \\\"off\\\". Favorites count updated from \\\"Favorites 2\\\" to \\\"Favorites 1\\\" and header.favorites.count from 2 to 1. Updates visible in real-time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Plain-text Professional Email template renders in <pre> tag with preserved text formatting, NO Markdown elements (no h1/h2/strong/em/hr). Previously verified Markdown Weekly Status Report renders with proper HTML: h1, h2, strong, hr elements. Both template types render correctly per their format.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted custom \\\"Meeting Notes\\\" and \\\"Test Template\\\". Both appeared immediately in library. Result count updated from 6→7→8 templates without page reload. Custom templates visible in main grid and searchable/filterable in real-time.\"}]}"
